loom
target loom, resume
 1 prepare: write the manifest and preserve its initialization scripts
 2 snapshot: pause writers, dump and snapshot consistent data into bucket lane-loom, then resume (30m limit)
 3 retention: keep 7 daily, 4 weekly and 6 monthly snapshots
bedrock
target this machine, resume
 1 prepare: copy the state store, the sealed secrets and the host profile
 2 snapshot: snapshot them into bucket lane-machine-box
 3 retention: keep 7 daily, 4 weekly and 6 monthly snapshots
